{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Mouth to mouth I speak with him.</b> The meaning: without intermediaries." "<b>In a vision and not in riddles.</b> The meaning: that I show him the speech as it is, like the form of the Tabernacle." "<b>And not in a riddle.</b> Like the great eagle." "<b>And the form of YHWH he beholds.</b> Like the meaning of 'show me now Your glory,' or that it is while awake."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:23.949429952Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}